<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The agenda panel (and the small panel): 18dp corners, concentric with the 28dp card at the
     ~9dp margins (28 - 9 ~ 18), so the band around it is even along the sides and at the corners. -->
